From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:10:03 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: awinic,aw88395: Add AW88461

Add the Awinic AW88461 I2S/TDM smart amplifier. It has a reset pin
and no DVDD supply property, like the other parts that are not the
AW88261.

Signed-off-by: seilent <github@seilent.net>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
index b9abb1094..e51270367 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ properties:
       - awinic,aw88261
       - awinic,aw88395
       - awinic,aw88399
+      - awinic,aw88461
 
   reg:
     maxItems: 1
